    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know vitamins are good but it feels like my doctor is just being super cautious. i've read that the more nutrients you get, the better your heart works. if i just keep my spinach intake consistent every day, wouldn't that just level out? i really want to do a massive green smoothie every morning to actually make an impact.",
